Subject: [PATCH] Log RC1-H-002; record NEW TEST/mark-capture workaround
 results

- Marked 'Interactive mark capture' PASS under RC1-H-001 workaround
  (5/5 learners captured successfully via WhatsApp NEW TEST flow after
  seeding a published blueprint).
- Marked 'Item analysis / blueprint analytics' FAIL: the WhatsApp
  Intervention Report shows impossible values (140% of learners
  affected per topic, against a 5-learner class) and a contradictory
  'Target group size: 0 learners' despite the companion Blueprint
  Assessment Report PDF correctly identifying 2 learners below the
  40% support threshold.
- Opened Defect Log entry RC1-H-002 (High). Root cause not yet
  investigated; entry records observed output facts only.
